{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Power</b> — The reason is that HaShem performs kindness, justice, and righteousness, and this is what He declared to His people: to walk after Him, to give them a path, for you have not come until now. And it is written: 'like the deed of the land of Egypt and like the deed of the land of Canaan,' and there it is written: 'you shall do My ordinances.' And here He has explained <b>the power of His deeds</b>."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 111, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:39:25.087915892Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}